  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C01",
      "text": "最后一秒归零。整排楼的灯，一盏接一盏熄灭。一轮红月，从楼缝里升起来，楼下响起桌椅翻倒的声音。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7af5d3211d66f7fa9a3707c76fdd778d33cf4b1d1bf26e0af80adb624ee3b595",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 9.8,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 294,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 0
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C02",
      "text": "夏凛拉了拉门链，回头看我。我在厨房，把卡式炉的火调到最旺，红油翻滚。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f585e4043ca87be191953b795ebeb94fbf9333e7995d16f39ce23b39c991adc2",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "start_frame": 297,
      "end_frame": 534,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C03",
      "text": "她说，外面天都塌了，你在煮火锅？我说，天塌了，才要吃好点。毛肚，牛肉，蔬菜，我都摆好了。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C03.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ab955522b3f1910e124480b7a943a02a52a5e46022135cf634e59ab17cf34da4",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 10.274844,
      "start_frame": 537,
      "end_frame": 846,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C04",
      "text": "就在这时，王大富扑到门上。他满手是血，拍着门喊，陈屿，开门，十根金条，全给你。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "35d317974e3679a28aa809cacdee793900e5dc6e9ce7c3f4aa57e3eaf76d5271",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 9.1,
      "start_frame": 849,
      "end_frame": 1122,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C05",
      "text": "我夹起毛肚，在红汤里涮了七下。隔着门，我说，当初在群里说我借钱囤货是傻子的时候，你可没这么客气。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C05.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d054e0af5a0758610bba54cc075d677e7c20111228de71f8cb612a7a6534ff40",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 10.9,
      "start_frame": 1125,
      "end_frame": 1452,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C06",
      "text": "楼梯转角，一道青灰色的人影扑了出来。王大富一声惨叫。夏凛说，他会死。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "193154d0bed0776898d59e365353eb0ecbdee52d8623f3a605dc805c3b2d8649",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "start_frame": 1455,
      "end_frame": 1677,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C07",
      "text": "我放下筷子。我不救人，我只保证，门前干净。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "bc18735e7a8eac52204a9fd78f69798ce59c4ddb998b230c8c92c40d6cc4e869",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "start_frame": 1680,
      "end_frame": 1821,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C08",
      "text": "我拿起院灯的控制器，按了下去。两束白光，同时照向转角。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "9c90ce4d8b376c77616fbaacc43427db548a56e0a0123281b5212162fb98e8fc",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "start_frame": 1824,
      "end_frame": 1995,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C09",
      "text": "那道人影捂着眼睛，往后缩了半步，发出一声尖啸。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "9a17d0eb1943703fda234d1d5269f9706367c8656a054e22626646568d78684a",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "start_frame": 1998,
      "end_frame": 2154,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C10",
      "text": "王大富连滚带爬冲回对门，砰地关上。他的惨叫，戛然而止。夏凛看着我说，你早就准备好了灯。我说，怕光，怕火，耳朵灵，我写过。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "22cb7010020694a4035d5d6ae4e3b76c97473e5e3cf0b0026e4d1bc7070c3b2d",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 13.6,
      "start_frame": 2157,
      "end_frame": 2565,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C11",
      "text": "可我还没来得及松一口气，楼梯另一头，传来一个女人的声音。陈屿！陈屿，你在吗？我来了！\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "755a64efd09b6004c3054b8ef1e402a0c19a98958841e8ff1bac2f9ebba16705",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 9.589844,
      "start_frame": 2568,
      "end_frame": 2856,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C12",
      "text": "是许知意。她白大褂撕裂，浑身是血，手里攥着那张纸卡。她身后，三道人影，正追上来。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "03e8afe9656d0abfc3f7386f58dba0d9d6d8b122782497b8d759d11e961678a7",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.695875,
      "start_frame": 2859,
      "end_frame": 3120,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C13",
      "text": "我对她喊，往亮的地方走，别离开这束光。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "100a5efa9eae87468cdb4d4a0d482b5cd92dbb591b4c4041651f644289242770",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 4.086719,
      "start_frame": 3123,
      "end_frame": 3246,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C14",
      "text": "手机亮起一行红字，检测到屋外幸存者，请求入住。开启入口，将暴露安全屋位置，是否确认？\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "36aff8ea0e088e2f11e6305a78fc287ae04274690fa26a3f4729bc136e1fa8bc",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.870031,
      "start_frame": 3249,
      "end_frame": 3516,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C15",
      "text": "夏凛站到我身后，短棍举起。我的手，按在门锁上。门外，她的呼吸，已经贴到了门板上。",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "52c49f523c839039ac8173d1bdf8a144af4cffc1bf855936c452e3e79a74105c",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "start_frame": 3519,
      "end_frame": 3771,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3
    }
  ],
